,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T23:28:55-07:00","id":1419520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MouseGBN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1260719-m20-play-by-post-seeking-players#post1260719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all. I stared into the abyss, searching for a Mage ST. I found the abyss starring back, because I am the Mage ST.<br /> <br /> So, finally breaking down and just doing it myself. The overarching story is largely inspired by the Cosmic Horror and Lovecraftian Horror genres. The scope of the game is largely confined to the local level and there is plenty of room for personal stories and other types of genres, but the main narrative is the one that I intend to use to tie all of the moving pieces together.<br /> <br /> I'm hosting the chronicle off-site on a different forum, so if you're interested in playing just let me know and I'll shoot you a link. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm totally in, please shoot me the link, but two questions:<br /> <br /> 1) Can I invite some friends and share backgrounds with them? (You know, the process for registering for this site can be rather tedious, with the spam checkers and what not).<br /> <br /> 2) What do you use to roll dice? Do you use bots, RNG, or just not use dice?<br /> <br /> Edit: Sorry, I found the link, but Question 1 still stands: can I invite some friends, bac